I think the ordering of the words could be improved, as for example ãƒ†ãƒ¬ãƒ“ comes toward the end of the deck and by that point you've already seen it in so many example sentences that it's easy.

I think if I was starting again I might have opted to stick with the JLAB deck https://ankiweb.net/shared/info/911122782 as that is n+1 and teaches grammar and uses natural native mined sentences. In the end it's not a huge problem, but I have realised recently that I am behind on grammar when looking at native content.
