·Î‰Ê±"¬Speaking as someone who has been learning for about 7 months, this deck was exactly what I was looking for.  It's greatly increased my vocabulary which has had a major impact on my reading comprehension.  Pretty much all of the words have already been relevant to me when reading so the sort order seems very well done.

I've seen it mentioned that this may not be the best deck for beginners and I think I understand that criticism.  This deck throws full on japanese sentences at you right out of the gate so that might be a bit intimidating for new learners, but I would say to just embrace it as it's better than the romaji approach of JLAB.  It's just a little extra immersion.


